# The files' sidebar and going somewhere (FilesNav.tsx, FilesGo.tsx: the core's stations {drive, here} and files.go):
# MBUI_FIXTURE=drive MBUI_WIN=1280x800. A pinned folder of another station from 团队共享, a station's row (its home), ⌘⇧G
# with a path typed, Tab completing it, Enter going there; then a station's row opened to its places.
timeout 20000
until 设计稿
wait 600
tap 照片
wait 900
tap 备份盘
wait 900
key cmd+shift+g
wait 600
type ~/
wait 700
key down
wait 400
key tab
wait 700
key enter
wait 900
tapxy 115 255
wait 1200
exit
